{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":18506.438637,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":18909.197375,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":18963.043908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18964.605426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18966.830981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18967.974750999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":18969.765562999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18971.435754,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":20716.009777,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21192.022886,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21242.844261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21244.318828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21245.997632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21247.738698999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21249.526286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21251.327624999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21252.272665,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":32709.1969,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":33048.329993,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":33097.167395000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":33099.025148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33100.614597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":33102.307042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33104.064394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":33105.488816000005,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":42707.198300000004,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":43213.547886,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":43268.583066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":43270.149992000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43271.927834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43273.724976000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43275.624011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43277.338258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":43279.156081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43280.99154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43282.326037,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":58502.160322,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt. Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":58852.203888000004,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized. If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":58899.882298000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58901.65309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58903.474298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58905.176897000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58906.459546000006,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"audio","t":58947.573997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58949.113131000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58950.832136000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58951.019006,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58993.714285,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58995.078375000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58996.767355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58996.967355,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":72105.247619,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109, ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72709.030487,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team—Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109—is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72755.799539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72757.479926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72759.26131399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72761.02444499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72762.726023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72764.718438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":72766.26258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":72768.136126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72769.38943,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":84744.90895099999,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":84998.05093499999,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":85043.12890499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":85044.25596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85045.96043199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":85046.126332,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":85080.40021899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85081.658461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":85081.76699399999,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94617.99328099999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":94950.088022,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":94995.673235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94997.271077,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94999.143402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95000.993774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":95001.104901,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":95037.12122799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95038.427141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95040.15908499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95041.435975,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":100636.682861,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100892.924665,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100938.968387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100940.442694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":100942.158914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100943.944498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":100944.077769,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116153.616446,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116509.07993899999,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116559.09279899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116560.372062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116562.045728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":116563.85094199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116565.630408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":116565.91351299999,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118874.308785,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":119255.90407599999,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":119308.882774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":119310.412574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119312.184899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119313.899026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119315.641315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":119317.47245799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119319.32284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":119319.445564,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129330.928222,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":129874.359306,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":129930.523904,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129931.985702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129933.697335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129935.40903799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129937.24251499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129939.074459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129940.85427499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129941.988139,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":141941.964869,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142364.144194,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that Nepal’s UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142419.55075199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142421.426492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":142423.054069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142424.971712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":142426.582804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142428.504824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":142430.088735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":142431.871906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142433.715838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":142433.850701,"samples":6888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":155853.413998,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland. Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":156207.129824,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany. He also attacked everything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":156256.49664199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156257.997389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":156259.66126999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156261.471051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156262.681701,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"audio","t":156297.279576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156298.755314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156300.11027099998,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"audio","t":156337.04834399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156338.465595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156340.152401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156340.66582199998,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":171440.163752,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":171840.184965,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":171894.90052599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171896.077976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171897.823109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171899.584708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171901.307538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171903.117339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171904.884926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171905.471168,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":176376.11563,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":176706.198425,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":176752.241848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176753.84547899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":176755.663092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176757.292561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176759.007991,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":192247.125437,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher. Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen."},{"kind":"text","t":192763.91365,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe. Most of the smaller islands are independent nations."},{"kind":"audio","t":192813.33615299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192814.834175,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192816.490555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192818.278844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192819.176283,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":192852.120362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192852.488225,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"audio","t":192891.689151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio",